<title>RUSSIA: Rouble unchanged at 5,397 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble unchanged at 5,397 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble was unchanged at 5,397 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX). Dealers said the central bank sold $1.48 million during trading.</p>
<p>					Sept 23		 Sept 20</p>
<p> Dollar rate			 5,397		   5,397</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	5.48		    5.48</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
